                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I brought together health care leaders from the Delaware Nurses Association to discuss the ongoing health care crisis\u2014and to strategize how we can protect care for our neighbors while supporting nurses and providers. \n\nEvery day Washington goes without a deal is another day the federal government stays closed and another day closer to skyrocketing premiums.",
