                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Nurses are the heart of our health care system, but cuts to Medicaid, skyrocketing premiums, and the government shutdown are making it harder for them to care for our neighbors. \n\nMy bipartisan National Nursing Workforce Center Act would help strengthen our nursing workforce\u2014which is crucial as the shutdown worsens the health care crisis and leaves families struggling to access the care they deserve.",
