                "retweet_count": 51,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m back in Washington, ready to work with my colleagues to reopen the government, protect health care, and prevent more disruptions to the programs Delawareans depend on. \n\nBut after choosing to shut down the government and put SNAP benefits for millions of Americans at risk, congressional Republicans are nowhere to be found.",
