                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Congressional Republicans have presented a false choice: that we can only reopen the government or address the health care crisis. Democrats have said for months that we can\u2014and we must\u2014do both. Every day we wait, Americans pay the price. https://t.co/7ivzY5XCPA",
