                "retweet_count": 37,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019ve heard from so many Delawareans throughout this shutdown\u2014whether they\u2019re federal workers, health care providers, or working parents\u2014and the message is clear: people are deeply concerned about how rising health care premiums will impact their families and neighbors. Here\u2019s what one Delawarean had to say.",
