                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1842,
                "retweet_count": 92,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The only thing congressional Republicans are more loyal to than Donald Trump is cutting Americans\u2019 health care. \n\nMillions face skyrocketing premiums. The largest Medicaid cut in U.S. history looms. Rural hospitals will close. Doctors\u2019 offices will shutter. \n\nAnd what do Republicans in Congress do? Pass a budget that ignores every one of these crises. \n\nI\u2019m voting no.",
