                "retweet_count": 340,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Donald Trump loves to own things and stick his name on them. Well, now he owns the American health care system. Millions losing coverage. Americans paying more for insurance. Everyone having to drive longer and wait more time for care. That is Trumpcare.",
