                "retweet_count": 247,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The budget passed\u2014but not with my vote. I won\u2019t support a Republican agenda built on cruelty and corruption\u2014and that\u2019s exactly what this budget was. I\u2019ll keep fighting to protect and expand health care for every Delawarean and every American. https://t.co/4gaGYFaspm",
