                "text": "No one should have to choose between their job and the people they love. And in just one month, Delaware will enter its Paid Leave Era. \n\nDelaware\u2019s Paid Family and Medical Leave law\u2014which I was proud to lead in the State Senate and am working to expand nationwide in Congress\u2014will strengthen families, support small businesses, and make our state more affordable for the people who make Delaware home. \n\nLearn more at https://t.co/dEsZXeMDEw.",
