                "text": "Every step of the way, congressional Republicans have tried to sabotage the Affordable Care Act and make health care more unaffordable and inaccessible. \n\nThey have no interest in solving this crisis\u2014even as my constituents and people across the country see their premiums spike. Democrats in the House and Senate will continue to hold them accountable for driving up the cost of care.",
