                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Delaware families are being squeezed from every direction\u2014not just by inflation, but by Trump Administration policies pouring fuel on the fire. My constituents who are facing rising costs at the grocery store and risk losing their health care coverage know affordability is not a hoax.\n\nNo matter our politics, we all want the same simple things: to feed our families, keep a roof over our heads, heat our homes, and work with dignity. That\u2019s what I\u2019ll keep fighting for.",
