                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Let\u2019s be clear: Donald Trump and Republicans in Congress created this health care affordability crisis. Their health care plan was the Big Ugly Bill\u2014massive cuts to Medicaid and Medicare and higher premiums for millions. So what they\u2019re doing now is like an arsonist lighting a house on fire and then showing up with a garden hose\u2014it doesn\u2019t fix anything, and it makes an even bigger mess.",
