                "text": "When the Trump administration announced plans to cut rates for home health care, I teamed up with a Republican colleague of mine to push back. And it worked\u2014the administration reversed course. \n\nTogether, we protected nearly a billion dollars in home health care funding so our constituents can get the care they need at home. And while standing up for Delawareans\u2019 care, we also proved that bipartisanship can still deliver real results.",
